WEBVTT

00:00:00.690 --> 00:00:02.510
Reaction Force!

00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:10.070
I won.

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:13.960
Thinking only of winning, I won.

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:15.930
Yuya...

00:00:16.810 --> 00:00:19.900
Just as you people wanted!

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:26.080
And I'm going to keep winning.

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:30.040
Until I destroy everything in the world!

00:00:44.130 --> 00:00:45.020
What is that?

00:00:46.050 --> 00:00:49.580
Things had turned out in the worst possible way.

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:54.770
In a world split into four dimensions,

00:00:54.770 --> 00:00:58.440
four boys exist, all with the same face.

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:02.340
Their dragons call to each other,

00:01:02.860 --> 00:01:05.980
almost as if seeking one another.

00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:44.010
The Supreme King's Reign

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:53.420
Hey, what's that thing?

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:56.190
A mirage? Probably not...

00:02:56.540 --> 00:03:01.460
What? Does this have something to do with 
the dimensional war Yuya mentioned?

00:03:03.790 --> 00:03:05.520
What is that thing?

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:08.400
Is it a duel monster?

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:13.740
I-It's okay... Don't worry.

00:03:13.740 --> 00:03:15.240
Stay calm, everyone!

00:03:20.020 --> 00:03:23.420
Is this... the scenery of another dimension?

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:37.500
I am Z-ARC. I have been reborn!

00:03:37.840 --> 00:03:39.970
Z-ARC... Where are you?

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:43.270
He must be summoning that giant 
dragon from somewhere!

00:03:44.420 --> 00:03:48.540
What's wrong? Lost your nerve, humans?

00:03:48.860 --> 00:03:53.020
Even though I have been revived, 
just as you wished?

00:03:53.020 --> 00:03:55.180
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:03:55.180 --> 00:03:57.790
We didn't wish for that!

00:03:57.790 --> 00:03:59.200
Ridiculous!

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:03.110
You humans created me.

00:04:03.110 --> 00:04:06.890
I won't let you deny it now!

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:10.910
We...

00:04:10.910 --> 00:04:12.900
...created Z-ARC?

00:04:16.490 --> 00:04:17.400
Layra...

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:20.840
Wait! Father's still inside!

00:04:21.540 --> 00:04:24.520
No, he's a cautious man.

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:26.810
He has already evacuated to somewhere safe.

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:32.020
I just heard it... Ray calling to Father!

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:33.230
What?

00:04:33.230 --> 00:04:35.220
She says, "Revive me, quickly."

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:39.970
She's screaming, "I'm the only 
one who can defeat Z-ARC!"

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:42.360
Wait! Wait, Layra!

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:46.090
We should look for Z-ARC.

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:47.110
Right.

00:04:50.550 --> 00:04:51.930
Why?

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:54.740
Why has Ray not revived? Why?

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:59.980
Was the life energy I injected 
insufficient, after all?

00:05:03.180 --> 00:05:05.240
Ray!

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:12.660
Well? Won't someone try to defeat me?

00:05:13.710 --> 00:05:15.990
Duel me!

00:05:19.180 --> 00:05:21.020
Our world...

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:25.640
This... This is the Aquaria Project's end result?

00:05:25.930 --> 00:05:30.710
After realizing the Professor's 
plan to create an ideal world,

00:05:30.710 --> 00:05:36.040
we produced a devil and are 
casting the world into ruin?

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:43.080
As commander of the Academia 
Xyz Expeditionary Force,

00:05:43.080 --> 00:05:45.510
I must take responsibility for this.

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:50.340
Let me ask you once more, Sora Shiunin.

00:05:51.890 --> 00:05:54.060
Will you help me?

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:57.660
No way!

00:05:59.620 --> 00:06:03.930
If you'd be willing to help me, 
though, I'll think about it.

00:06:07.920 --> 00:06:08.950
Want one?

00:06:12.030 --> 00:06:14.390
Foolish humans...

00:06:14.390 --> 00:06:18.590
Steel yourselves and fight me. Then die!

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:26.200
Until the day that only one remains... 
Until the entire world is destroyed!

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:38.680
Z-ARC! We'll face you!

00:06:38.680 --> 00:06:41.910
Stop hiding and show yourself already!

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:46.180
Oh? So I've finally found my prey...

00:06:56.370 --> 00:06:58.410
Finally showing yourself, huh?

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:05.820
Finally showing myself?

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:11.140
I've been in front of you, all this time.

00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:13.840
You aren't Yuya?

00:07:13.840 --> 00:07:17.620
You claim to be a monster 
fused with a human?

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:20.440
Answer me! Where is Yuya?

00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:22.890
Are you controlling Yuya?!

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:26.410
This is who I really am.

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:30.680
Yuya Sakaki was an avatar 
to enable my revival.

00:07:31.080 --> 00:07:32.830
He's gone now.

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:34.300
What?

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:40.230
You'll be the first two sacrifices 
to humanity's extinction.

00:07:40.800 --> 00:07:42.650
Be proud.

00:07:47.620 --> 00:07:48.710
Duel!

00:07:49.430 --> 00:07:50.780
My turn!

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:53.760
Bear witness... The original, the ultimate.

00:07:53.760 --> 00:07:57.800
Mastering both right and might. 
Power without peer...

00:07:57.800 --> 00:07:59.920
Let it burn into your eyes!

00:08:00.440 --> 00:08:03.320
I set the Pendulum Scale

00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:08.810
with Scale 0 Supreme King Gate Zero and 
Scale 13 Supreme King Gate Infinity!

00:08:13.490 --> 00:08:18.080
Now I can summon monsters between 
Levels 1 and 12 simultaneously.

00:08:18.420 --> 00:08:19.520
Pendulum?

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:22.050
Did he say Scale 0 and 13?

00:08:22.050 --> 00:08:23.850
Pendulum Summon!

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:27.670
Gather to me, my servants!

00:08:28.330 --> 00:08:30.620
Supreme King Dragon Darkwurms!

00:08:33.850 --> 00:08:35.860
I now end my turn.

00:08:36.270 --> 00:08:38.250
He is using Pendulum?

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:39.450
That's Yuya...

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:42.760
Yuya must still exist inside him.

00:08:42.760 --> 00:08:43.570
Yeah.

00:08:43.850 --> 00:08:47.360
Even if a devil duelist has taken over his body,

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:51.410
deep in his heart, Yuya Sakaki's spirit remains.

00:08:51.410 --> 00:08:53.200
I believe that to be true!

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:54.710
My turn!

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:58.830
I activate my spell card Polymerization 
from my hand,

00:08:58.830 --> 00:09:01.790
and send Destiny Hero — Decider

00:09:01.790 --> 00:09:05.860
and Destiny Hero — Drilldark to 
the graveyard to fuse them!

00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:08.970
Hero who decides the fate of victory.

00:09:08.970 --> 00:09:11.740
Hero who pierces the bedrock of destiny.

00:09:11.740 --> 00:09:15.160
Become one now, and reign 
over a future of darkness!

00:09:15.160 --> 00:09:16.830
Fusion Summon!

00:09:16.830 --> 00:09:20.820
Come on, Destiny Hero — Dystopia!

00:09:25.230 --> 00:09:27.160
Dystopia's effect!

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:32.440
I deal the attack points of Decider, used as a 
fusion component, as damage to Z-ARC!

00:09:34.710 --> 00:09:37.590
I activate Supreme King Gate 
Zero's Pendulum Effect.

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:40.940
As long as there is a Supreme 
King monster on the field,

00:09:40.940 --> 00:09:43.190
damage cannot be dealt to me.

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:45.790
Can you hear me, Yuya Sakaki?

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:48.030
It's me, Edo Phoenix!

00:09:48.320 --> 00:09:53.640
And Supreme King Gate Infinity's 
effect increases my life

00:09:53.640 --> 00:09:56.470
by the damage that would have been done.

00:09:56.840 --> 00:09:58.460
Yuya, answer me!

00:09:58.460 --> 00:10:02.080
Have you lost your spirit completely?

00:10:05.060 --> 00:10:06.700
Then, I will go with battle.

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:10.560
Dystopia attacks Darkwurm!

00:10:13.940 --> 00:10:16.490
Darkwurm's effect activates!

00:10:16.490 --> 00:10:19.260
As long as a Supreme King monster 
is on my side of the field,

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:22.200
attacks against Darkwurm are negated!

00:10:23.940 --> 00:10:29.400
Then, I activate my spell card 
D-Soul Burst from my hand.

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:31.910
I halve Dystopia's attack points,

00:10:31.910 --> 00:10:36.020
and deal the damage to both players!

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:38.440
Fool...

00:10:38.440 --> 00:10:40.670
Have you forgotten that as long

00:10:40.670 --> 00:10:44.360
as I have Supreme King monsters, 
you cannot deal damage to me?

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:47.330
I activate Supreme King Gate Zero's effect.

00:10:50.310 --> 00:10:51.420
Yuya...

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:55.320
If you can hear my voice, even if 
only faintly, answer me!

00:10:55.320 --> 00:10:58.400
And Supreme King Gate Infinity's effect

00:10:58.400 --> 00:11:02.740
increases my life points by the 
damage I would have taken.

00:11:06.010 --> 00:11:08.910
Adding more life points?

00:11:09.400 --> 00:11:11.850
You won't answer at all?

00:11:13.120 --> 00:11:15.020
Dystopia's effect.

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:19.640
Once on each of our turns, when its 
attack or defense points change,

00:11:19.640 --> 00:11:22.160
I can destroy one card on your side of the field!

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:24.250
Noble Justice!

00:11:31.170 --> 00:11:32.860
That won't work, either?

00:11:33.320 --> 00:11:36.610
I set one card and end my turn.

00:11:39.610 --> 00:11:41.710
This time, I'll face you.

00:11:41.710 --> 00:11:44.840
Yuya, I'll make you remember your duel

00:11:44.840 --> 00:11:46.320
with my own duel!

00:11:46.320 --> 00:11:49.350
My turn! Draw!

00:11:57.220 --> 00:12:01.110
I can... I know I can reach it.

00:12:01.770 --> 00:12:03.740
Yuya's heart.

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:06.860
Continuous Spell Frightfur Sanctuary!

00:12:06.860 --> 00:12:09.800
I activate this card by sending 
one card from my hand,

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:13.580
and two Frightfur monsters from my 
Extra Deck, to my graveyard!

00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:21.740
I send Edge Imp Frightfuloid and Frightfur 
Bear and Tiger to the graveyard!

00:12:22.590 --> 00:12:27.260
Edge Imp Frightfuloid in my graveyard 
is treated as a Frightfur monster.

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:30.760
And I activate my spell card Frightfur Fusion!

00:12:31.070 --> 00:12:34.110
I banish Frightfur Bear, Frightfur Tiger,

00:12:34.110 --> 00:12:38.840
and Edge Imp Frightfuloid in my 
graveyard to Fusion Summon.

00:12:39.890 --> 00:12:42.270
The inanimate toy that houses the devil,

00:12:42.270 --> 00:12:45.210
annihilate the fools who oppose me!

00:12:45.490 --> 00:12:46.910
Fusion Summon!

00:12:47.610 --> 00:12:51.550
Appear, the magical beast that's 
a combination of all toys!

00:12:51.550 --> 00:12:53.900
Frightfur Chimera!

00:12:56.790 --> 00:13:00.460
Yuya, remember... Remember dueling with me.

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:01.580
Battle.

00:13:01.580 --> 00:13:04.160
Chimera attacks Darkwurm!

00:13:10.080 --> 00:13:14.240
The effects of Supreme King Gates 
Zero and Infinity activate!

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:18.840
Damage is negated, and I gain life 
equal to that which I would have taken.

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:22.060
8000 life points?

00:13:24.260 --> 00:13:29.120
Now, I think I'll take that Darkwurm I destroyed.

00:13:29.550 --> 00:13:34.810
When Chimera destroys a monster in 
battle and sends it to the graveyard,

00:13:34.810 --> 00:13:38.700
I can Special Summon that monster to my field.

00:13:39.650 --> 00:13:43.630
The Darkwurm you destroyed 
is a Pendulum Monster.

00:13:43.630 --> 00:13:47.140
It is sent to my Extra Deck, not my graveyard.

00:13:47.140 --> 00:13:48.490
I know that...

00:13:48.490 --> 00:13:50.680
This has happened before.

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:52.010
Don't you remember?

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:55.480
The destroyed Odd-Eyes isn't in the graveyard.

00:13:57.160 --> 00:14:00.150
Odd-Eyes is in the Extra Deck!

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:01.850
Look at this.

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:03.450
That is...

00:14:07.190 --> 00:14:09.190
He picked it up?

00:14:10.230 --> 00:14:13.920
Now, remember what happened back then.

00:14:13.920 --> 00:14:16.330
In your first duel with me!

00:14:16.610 --> 00:14:18.940
Master!

00:14:30.690 --> 00:14:33.650
I set one card and end my turn.

00:14:36.940 --> 00:14:39.260
My turn!

00:14:41.290 --> 00:14:43.210
Pendulum Summon.

00:14:43.210 --> 00:14:45.270
Return again...

00:14:47.270 --> 00:14:50.000
Supreme King Dragon Darkwurm!

00:14:52.670 --> 00:14:56.170
I activate my trap card D-Hyper Nova!

00:14:56.170 --> 00:14:58.910
I can activate it when a D-HERO is on my field

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:02.310
and you Special Summon a monster.

00:15:02.620 --> 00:15:07.370
I destroy all monsters Special 
Summoned to your side of the field!

00:15:07.370 --> 00:15:10.490
And I activate my trap Frightfur Parade.

00:15:10.810 --> 00:15:13.290
When there's a Frightfur monster on my field

00:15:13.290 --> 00:15:16.860
and an effect has been activated to 
destroy one of your monsters,

00:15:16.860 --> 00:15:19.530
I can destroy all cards on your field,

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:22.900
dealing 500 damage to you for each!

00:15:23.320 --> 00:15:26.500
You can't use your Gate effects on this.

00:15:33.690 --> 00:15:34.520
Yes!

00:15:34.520 --> 00:15:35.740
We destroyed them all.

00:15:37.180 --> 00:15:40.650
There is still a chance. Do not 
give up, Sora Shiunin.

00:15:40.650 --> 00:15:42.190
Of course there is...

00:15:42.190 --> 00:15:46.120
And no need for formality. Just call me Sora.

00:15:46.550 --> 00:15:50.490
Sora, let us keep this up and 
get our feelings through...

00:15:50.490 --> 00:15:52.600
To the Yuya who is still inside!

00:15:55.830 --> 00:16:00.840
Fools can never recognize their mistakes.

00:16:00.840 --> 00:16:05.810
You don't realize that you signed your 
death warrants with that one move.

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:06.970
What?

00:16:06.970 --> 00:16:08.450
What are you talking about?

00:16:08.760 --> 00:16:12.090
When cards on my side of the field are destroyed,

00:16:12.090 --> 00:16:16.420
I can Special Summon this 
monster from my hand.

00:16:16.420 --> 00:16:18.940
Controller of time. Controller of stars.

00:16:18.940 --> 00:16:22.890
All-powerful, all-knowing magician 
with power over spacetime,

00:16:23.160 --> 00:16:27.480
descend and give me your power!

00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:30.230
Come out, Astrograph Sorcerer!

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:42.780
That monster...

00:16:43.470 --> 00:16:47.220
It's the one that appeared when 
Yuya became Z-ARC.

00:16:49.800 --> 00:16:52.760
I activate Astrograph Sorcerer's effect.

00:16:53.340 --> 00:16:56.870
I restore all destroyed cards!

00:17:01.240 --> 00:17:03.930
After we finally got rid of them all...

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:11.880
What is he trying to do?

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:18.940
Astrograph Sorcerer tributes 
itself to activate its effect

00:17:18.940 --> 00:17:26.190
and banish Supreme King Dragons from 
my deck, Extra Deck, field, or graveyard!

00:17:26.460 --> 00:17:30.730
Astrograph Sorcerer, become my fodder!

00:17:31.430 --> 00:17:33.020
Supreme King Dragons...

00:17:33.020 --> 00:17:35.820
Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon,

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:38.300
Clear Wing Synchro Dragon,

00:17:38.300 --> 00:17:41.340
Starving Dragon Fusion Dragon,

00:17:41.340 --> 00:17:44.010
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:17:44.010 --> 00:17:46.480
Become my foundation!

00:17:57.410 --> 00:17:58.970
Wh-What?

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:00.490
What's he doing?

00:18:03.190 --> 00:18:05.210
I don't know what is happening...

00:18:05.210 --> 00:18:08.120
But let's evacuate to somewhere safe,  Sora!

00:18:13.910 --> 00:18:17.200
What's going on here?

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:18.910
Syun, look at that.

00:18:19.440 --> 00:18:20.700
Edo and Sora.

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:23.260
And the one they're fighting...

00:18:23.260 --> 00:18:25.320
Is that Yuya?

00:18:26.390 --> 00:18:30.050
That might be the Z-ARC that 
Mr. Sakaki was talking about.

00:18:30.050 --> 00:18:31.180
What?

00:18:31.180 --> 00:18:33.880
No, it must be him.

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:35.460
He has revived.

00:18:36.560 --> 00:18:41.930
He's Yuya, Ute, Hugo, and Joeri united.

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:43.720
The devil duelist?

00:18:44.570 --> 00:18:47.200
Let's hurry. Edo is in trouble.

00:18:47.760 --> 00:18:53.180
Ultimate dragon, who reigns 
over the four king dragons,

00:18:53.180 --> 00:18:57.150
in this moment, become one with me!

00:18:57.440 --> 00:18:58.880
Unity Summon!

00:18:59.300 --> 00:19:03.430
Come out, Supreme King Z-ARC!

00:19:25.320 --> 00:19:31.150
Pendulum, Xyz, Synchro, Fusion...

00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:36.170
I am the supreme being who rules them all!

00:19:41.250 --> 00:19:45.180
A human has fused with 
a duel monster?

00:19:46.690 --> 00:19:49.940
That enormous dragon was Z-ARC?

00:19:51.280 --> 00:19:52.360
Let's finish this.

00:19:52.360 --> 00:19:55.070
Field Spell Crossover.

00:20:03.500 --> 00:20:06.170
2000-point penalty for entering the battle.

00:20:06.680 --> 00:20:07.800
Kaito!

00:20:07.800 --> 00:20:08.890
Kurosaki!

00:20:09.320 --> 00:20:13.020
I applaud your courage in facing me.

00:20:13.500 --> 00:20:15.590
But this is as far as it goes.

00:20:15.590 --> 00:20:17.770
Behold my power.

00:20:17.770 --> 00:20:22.800
When I descend, I destroy all 
monsters on the field.

00:20:22.800 --> 00:20:23.660
What?

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:24.730
No!

00:20:24.730 --> 00:20:25.640
Impossible.

00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:36.220
And I deal their players the sum of the 
destroyed monsters' attack points.

00:20:37.160 --> 00:20:40.550
Dystopia has 1400 attack points.

00:20:40.830 --> 00:20:44.520
Chimera has 2800 attack points.

00:20:44.520 --> 00:20:47.360
The total is 4200.

00:21:04.500 --> 00:21:06.010
Edo! Sora!

00:21:12.380 --> 00:21:15.670
Is that Z-ARC, the one Mr. Sakaki 
was talking about?

00:21:16.070 --> 00:21:17.490
What happened to Yuya?

00:21:17.820 --> 00:21:22.240
Yuya has... become Z-ARC.

00:21:22.240 --> 00:21:26.520
And he has become Supreme 
King Z-ARC, the fusion of

00:21:26.520 --> 00:21:28.730
that giant dragon and human.

00:21:30.040 --> 00:21:35.220
Take care of the rest... You two, from Xyz...

00:21:39.160 --> 00:21:44.820
Bring back Yuya... no matter what.

00:21:48.820 --> 00:21:51.560
Very well. I'll leave the rest to you.

00:21:57.520 --> 00:21:59.780
You two are next, then?

00:22:01.080 --> 00:22:04.940
Let's go. That form doesn't suit you.

00:22:04.940 --> 00:22:06.290
Come back to us.

00:22:06.290 --> 00:22:08.070
My turn!

00:23:49.140 --> 00:23:50.600
Sora and Edo fought,

00:23:50.600 --> 00:23:55.080
believing that some part of Yuya, 
however faint, remained inside him.

00:23:55.760 --> 00:23:59.650
I will retrieve Yuya and Ute.

00:23:59.650 --> 00:24:02.120
Will I fight Xyz users now?

